<title>USA: Fleet finances New York apartment project.</title>
<headline>Fleet finances New York apartment project.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Financial Group Inc said Thursday it extended a $120 million letter of credit to Resnick Eight Avenue Associates LLC to finance construction of a 550-unit apartment complex in Manhattan.</p>
<p>The project is part of the New York State Housing Finance Agency's &quot;80/20&quot; affordable housing program, Fleet said.</p>
<p>Under program rules, no more than 80 percent of the units may be leased at market rates, Fleet said. At least 20 percent must be leased to low-income residents.</p>
<p>Fleet said it has provided financing totaling $525 million for seven &quot;80/20&quot; projects in Manhattan.</p>
</text>
